        ],
        "paragraph": "WACKER exploits the potential of modern molecular biology and genetic engineering methods to produce high-value specialty and performance chemicals right through to complex proteins based on renewable raw materials. For instance, we use a genetically optimized E.coli system (ESETEC<sup>®</sup>) to produce pharmaceutical proteins as highly specific active ingredients for drugs.\nWe also prioritize safety when using genetically modified techniques, in that we comply with laws and regulations, industrywide standards and our own rigorous internal safety provisions. We handle genetically engineered organisms solely in closed systems, which almost prevents anything from being released into the atmosphere. WACKER itself does not make any genetically modified substances, nor does it distribute them.",
